@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5030
@competitionId = 1
@token = replace-with-organizer-token

### Results include correct-answer count and elapsed time; ranking is correct count descending, then duration ascending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizer/competitions/{{competitionId}}/results
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Results for one ranking group
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizer/competitions/{{competitionId}}/results?rankingGroupName=Kinh%20t%E1%BA%BF%20v%C3%A0%20h%E1%BA%A1%20t%E1%BA%A7ng
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export all ranking groups as .xlsx
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizer/competitions/{{competitionId}}/results/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export one ranking group as .xlsx
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizer/competitions/{{competitionId}}/results/excel?rankingGroupName=Kinh%20t%E1%BA%BF%20v%C3%A0%20h%E1%BA%A1%20t%E1%BA%A7ng
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid ranking group returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizer/competitions/{{competitionId}}/results?rankingGroupName=not-a-competition-group
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
